LiteChat 轻聊助手
Copyright (c) 2026 LiteChat contributors

This project is a simplified derivative of Jev Chat Assistant. It reuses and
adapts that project's non-invasive capture layer (Android accessibility-service
adapters, the screenshot + on-device OCR fallback, the floating overlay shell
and the guarded input writer). Everything else — the single-API configuration,
the universal multi-protocol LLM client, the single-call prompt, the Windows
desktop application and the packaging — is original to this project.

